&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#hubspot-aeo-vs-otterly-how-are-they-different"&gt;HubSpot AEO vs. Otterly: How are they different?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
