 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#frequently-asked-questions-about-hubspot-aeo-vs-otterly"&gt;Frequently Asked Questions About HubSpot AEO vs. Otterly&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;a&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;HubSpot AEO vs. Otterly: How are they different?&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.hubspot.com/marketing/answer-engine-optimization"&gt;HubSpot AEO&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;is built into the HubSpot platform. It tracks how your brand appears across ChatGPT, Gemini, and Perplexity, then connects those insights directly to your CRM data, marketing campaigns, and content tools.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;When it surfaces a gap, you can publish a blog post, schedule a LinkedIn update, or engage on Reddit without leaving HubSpot. The prompt suggestions it gives you aren’t generic industry templates — they’re built from what it already knows about your company, competitors, and customers.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.hubspot.com/marketing/answer-engine-optimization"&gt;&lt;img src="https://53.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hub/53/hubfs/MH_AEO_Recommendations_EN_03102026-1.webp?width=2880&amp;amp;height=1620&amp;amp;name=MH_AEO_Recommendations_EN_03102026-1.webp" width="2880" height="1620" alt="HubSpot AEO tool recommendations that track how your brand appears and provides suggestions" style="height: auto; max-width: 100%; width: 2880px;"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Otterly is a purpose-built content intelligence platform for AI search. It calls itself “neutral and objective,” tracking from a first-person perspective on a daily basis. It covers a wider range of AI engines out of the box (ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews, Google AI Mode, Perplexity, and Microsoft Copilot), with Google Gemini and Claude available as paid add-ons.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Otterly offers strong standalone reporting and integrates with Looker Studio, a public API, and an MCP server. What it doesn’t do is connect that data to a CRM, marketing automation, or content creation workflow — that part is up to you.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The core decision lens:&lt;/strong&gt; if your team just needs AI visibility monitoring and has a separate content workflow you’re happy with, Otterly works. If you want AEO insights to flow directly into the tools where you create content, run campaigns, and track pipeline, HubSpot AEO is the stronger fit.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;a&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 
