&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;a&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;What is AEO and how is it different from SEO?&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;SEO focuses on visibility in traditional search results. AEO focuses on visibility in AI-generated answers. That’s the clean version. The messier reality is that &lt;a href="https://blog.hubspot.com/marketing/ai-seo"&gt;the two share plenty of tactics&lt;/a&gt; but differ in measurement, tooling, and what “winning” actually means.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;When someone Googles a question, they get a list of blue links. When they ask ChatGPT, Gemini, or Perplexity the same question, they get a synthesized, &lt;a href="https://blog.hubspot.com/marketing/semantic-search"&gt;semantic search result&lt;/a&gt; that may or may not include your brand. Answer engine optimization is the practice of making sure your brand shows up in those answers, accurately and favorably.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;This matters now because buyer behavior is shifting faster than most teams realize. Rather than clicking through ten results, people increasingly ask AI for recommendations and act on the first response they get. If you’re not in that answer, you’re not in the consideration set.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quick checklist: Do you need to care about AEO now?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;You probably do if:&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Your buyers research solutions by asking AI tools before visiting vendor sites&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;You’re in a category where competitors are already showing up in AI answers&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;You track branded search and want to understand AI mentions alongside it&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Your content team is creating thought-leadership and wants to know if it’s landing in AI channels&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;You can likely hold off if:&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Your sales cycle is almost entirely outbound or referral-based&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;You’re in a heavily regulated category where AI rarely surfaces specific vendors&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;You don’t have anyone to act on the insights (data without action isn’t worth much)&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Not sure where you stand? The &lt;a href="https://www.hubspot.com/products/aeo"&gt;AEO Grader&lt;/a&gt; gives you a free baseline on your current AI visibility before you invest in any platform.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;a&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;Profound vs. Semrush AEO At a&amp;nbsp;Glance&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Here’s the honest summary: Profound and Semrush are solving different problems. Profound is a purpose-built AEO tool. Semrush is a full-stack digital marketing platform that added AI visibility features to an already large product suite. That distinction shapes everything from the depth of data to the workflow it fits into.&lt;/p&gt; 
